B.aXq=new A.K(6,"Pr\xe9venir la triade l\xe9tale","Hypothermie (T\xb0<35\xb0C) : couverture chauffante, r\xe9chauffer liquides IV. Acidose (pH<7.2) : bicarbonate si pH<7.1 + corriger la cause. Coagulopathie (fibrinog\xe8ne<1.5 g/L) : fibrinog\xe8ne IV, PFC, plaquettes. TEG/ROTEM guide la transfusion cibl\xe9e.")
