B.aVg=new A.K(1,"Phase 0 (0\u20135 min) \u2014 Stabilisation","Position lat\xe9rale de s\xe9curit\xe9. O\u2082 haut d\xe9bit 15 L/min. VVP \u22652. Glyc\xe9mie capillaire (hypoglyc\xe9mie = cause traitable). ECG. Bilan sanguin : NFS, ionogramme, cr\xe9atinine, taux d'anti\xe9pileptiques, alcool\xe9mie. Thiamine 100 mg IV AVANT G50% si malnutrition suspect\xe9e.")
