B.a9U=new A.ai("Sulfate de Magn\xe9sium",B.E,B.S,"2 g IV","IV en 20 min","Si r\xe9ponse insuffisante apr\xe8s 1h de traitement standard. Dose unique. Surveiller hypotension et ROT.",!1)
